ORIGINAL WORK

fsvng is a C++ rewrite of fsv 0.9, the 3D File System Visualizer:
    Copyright (C) 1999 Daniel Richard G. <skunk@mit.edu>
    http://fsv.sourceforge.net/
    Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2 or any later version.
The layout, camera and animation algorithms in src/geometry, src/camera and src/animation are
ported from fsv's geometry.c, camera.c, animation.c and colexp.c, and stay under that licence.
The fsv 0.9 sources themselves were removed from this repository's tree on 2026-10-19; they
remain in its git history and in the upstream release tarball.

THIRD-PARTY CODE IN RELEASE BINARIES

